Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting bones,\Nwe'll reach it, we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so truly grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran into you on that day so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.74,0:00:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We laughed every moment\Nwith tears in our eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we knew we weren't alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The blowing wind came in\Nand joined us on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.22,0:00:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And with it I know we'll rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be flying up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.88,0:00:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why are you giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why you want to fight alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what kind of future\Ndo you think you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.88,0:01:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dream is already in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn off forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.86,0:01:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting\Nplans, we'll reach it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.54,0:01:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We are whole from the horizon\Nout on the edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.62,0:01:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is a place that I'd want to\Ntake you to, Let's head for it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for the way we already know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.28,0:01:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.36,0:01:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You scream by your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't break through the silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.32,0:01:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling defeated, It\Ncrushes your helpless heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got your back. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put our fate within\Nthis light under the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.94,0:02:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you close your eyes and\Njust listen to my voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find the answer together. I'm\Ntelling you, in our path, I trust that it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.86,0:02:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Will lead us to another sea, untattered.\NCause now we are home on the horizon,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.52,0:02:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,out on the edge of the world
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a place that I\Nwant to take you to. Let's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.86,0:02:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,head for it then But after\Nthe way we already know
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.36,0:02:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.52,0:02:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe came here to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.92,0:02:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, really surprised me too. That's\Na relief. So Nami's in good hands then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,One problem I don't know how we'll\Nbe able to meet up with them again,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.44,0:02:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but once they find out\Nthat you're coming back,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.02,0:02:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll be real happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.28,0:03:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we're through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.38,0:03:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.76,0:03:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry we ever came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.98,0:03:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too ashamed to ever\Nface Nami after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.30,0:03:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Things will work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.66,0:03:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami and the rest of our friends\Nhave been pretty worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.00,0:03:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.56,0:03:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I dragged everyone through hell and back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.48,0:03:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.39,0:03:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's clearing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.70,0:04:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's right here, Ria!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.78,0:04:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.42,0:04:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think he'll be able to hear us\Nthrough this tiny shard? I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.36,0:04:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,When I spoke to you through the mirror\Nbefore, the whole thing cracked apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.92,0:04:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But the pieces should\Nstill be on that tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.70,0:04:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It broke!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.62,0:04:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.40,0:04:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If even a single shard that connects to\Nthis mirror is still there, we're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.18,0:04:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Luffy! Hey! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.12,0:04:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.03,0:04:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.06,0:04:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,On the tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.62,0:04:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.53,0:04:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.74,0:04:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.82,0:04:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me! If you hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.02,0:04:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.40,0:04:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.30,0:04:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.82,0:05:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep yelling if\Nyou follow my voice, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.64,0:05:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Aha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.22,0:05:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.66,0:05:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't believe you guys found me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.48,0:05:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Nami was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.10,0:05:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is Chopper's voice\Ncoming from a mirror?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.68,0:05:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of a long story, but they're\Nall in another dimension right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.42,0:05:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.20,0:05:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper, you guys good?\NYeah, Luffy! We're fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.48,0:05:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you are, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.72,0:05:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.63,0:05:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.78,0:05:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.96,0:05:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.62,0:05:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell Sanji that we're all glad he's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.64,0:05:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So how are ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.26,0:05:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to report everyone has been\Nrescued and is currently safe in the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.48,0:05:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.62,0:05:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.82,0:05:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Brook even scored us a copy\Nof Big Mom's poneglyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.00,0:05:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.22,0:06:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd do it. Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.44,0:06:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You big mushy jerk face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.86,0:06:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't butter us up like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.42,0:06:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, doofus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.62,0:06:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,WHAT!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.53,0:06:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You silly little goose!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.16,0:06:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, while it's great you Karoo\Nfound Sanji, I hope things are settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.44,0:06:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Being honest, not exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.82,0:06:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So here's the deal:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.72,0:06:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,we're crashing big mom's tea party\Nand busting up Sanji's wedding!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.24,0:07:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus we're gonna save his family too\Nafter that he's coming home for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.54,0:07:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.06,0:07:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.92,0:07:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.90,0:07:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She's much too strong for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.00,0:07:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I would never risk Nami's, I mean,\Neverybody's life for my own problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.96,0:07:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.36,0:07:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.18,0:07:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine, whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.24,0:07:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that you and Lumi\Ngot into a huge fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.16,0:07:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so worried, you look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.94,0:07:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy! You too! You too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.44,0:07:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.94,0:08:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So basically, we help out Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.86,0:08:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And he comes back. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.52,0:08:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, was that Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.74,0:08:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, don't think\NI'll let you off easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.72,0:08:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,For You're freaking me\Nout like that, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.24,0:08:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.54,0:08:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.62,0:08:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's forget about that for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.06,0:08:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're short on time. We gotta focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.70,0:08:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The tea party will be starting soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.30,0:08:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll have the rest\Nof my life to resent you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.22,0:08:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that a proposal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.16,0:08:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Nami! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.64,0:08:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.98,0:08:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're back to normal, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.66,0:08:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.12,0:08:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe we know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.60,0:08:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad you're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.88,0:09:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and I should mention,\NSanji's sister saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.46,0:09:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So I want to help her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.14,0:09:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm in agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.64,0:09:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,However, this won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.78,0:09:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though we're not aiming\Nto defeat Big Mom herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.22,0:09:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,she enjoys those tea parties more\Nthan anything else in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.76,0:09:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,By crashing it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.08,0:09:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll no doubt be provoking the wrath\Nof one of the Emperors of the Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.18,0:09:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And she's not the only concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.82,0:09:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've had a run-in with\Na couple of her ministers already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.52,0:09:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's only scratching the\Nsurface of the Big Mom Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.96,0:09:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There will be even more fearsome enemies
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.14,0:09:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,that will be in attendance\Nat that ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.12,0:09:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,underground moguls and other seedy\Ncharacters are also on the guest list.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.28,0:10:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The opposition will be meager but mighty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.56,0:10:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The ten of us that are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.20,0:10:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We refuse to help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.52,0:10:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't count us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.06,0:10:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your team's only got eight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.72,0:10:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope your dumb plan gets you killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.16,0:10:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.88,0:10:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I have already informed\Neveryone that's gathered here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.24,0:10:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's important that I share\Nthis tidbit with you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.76,0:10:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're familiar with the\Nman Capone, Buggy, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.14,0:10:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the guy who took Soji.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.20,0:10:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,As a fellow member of the worst\Ngeneration, his reputation rivals Jerome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.80,0:10:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He and his crewmates hail from the West\NBlue and control the criminal underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.16,0:10:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, Mafia's run\Nrampant where he's from.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.32,0:10:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There's five families of the West,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.24,0:10:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and at the head of one of those\Ncriminal organizations is Gang Buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.86,0:11:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The name Gang traces back to his younger\Ndays when he was a notorious hitman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.28,0:11:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He killed people?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.44,0:11:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the rumors, as a young\Nlad, he was a sick individual.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.28,0:11:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He took great pleasure\Nin maiming the helpless
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.38,0:11:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and watching the light\Nfade from their very eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.70,0:11:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy sounds like he's really awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.52,0:11:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That same warp skill set is what\Nallowed him to thrive in crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.18,0:11:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How is the flavor, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.12,0:11:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not quite bitter enough for my taste!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.88,0:11:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Might I recommend the house special?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.98,0:11:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.86,0:11:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You two-timed bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.00,0:11:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that, buddy? Bitter enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.20,0:12:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Even as a young mobster, he sought out the\Nmost powerful bosses in the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.22,0:12:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,After establishing his own family,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.42,0:12:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,he killed any rival leader\Nhe could, and no one else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.96,0:12:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Benji?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.76,0:12:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stick him up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.04,0:12:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going rogue?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.64,0:12:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're outmanned, my friend. Benji!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.84,0:12:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,However, he never showed interest in\Nhis enemy's position or territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.46,0:12:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He only take their valuables.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.52,0:12:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Chaos would always follow\Nhis assassinations,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.68,0:12:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and he took great pleasure in watching\Nthe different factions eat themselves
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.24,0:12:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Alive in bloody power struggles. That man\Ntruly is a tasteless fellow. It's as they
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.98,0:13:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,say though sow the wind reap the whirlwind\Nhe soon became a target of the many
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.84,0:13:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,hungry for a taste of sweet vengeance
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.80,0:13:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nevertheless, Neji
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.64,0:13:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,reveled in that very
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.60,0:13:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,fact he built himself a powerful fortress\Nand fought them all off while mocking
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.80,0:13:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,his rival's efforts. Once he grew tired\Nwith life on land, he set out to sea and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.50,0:13:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,repeated the same pattern what happened\Nhere who did this to the captain damn it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.06,0:13:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,he then became well known for taking out\Nthe leaders of well-known pirate crews
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.30,0:13:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,needless to say that much notoriety\Ncomes with some downsides as well
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.38,0:13:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,he now needed a safe haven from\Nhis enemies so allying himself
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.16,0:13:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,with an emperor of the sea seemed\Nlike the best course of action
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.30,0:14:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,big mom respected his finely honed\Ncaution and defensive capabilities
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.42,0:14:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So for the upcoming tea party,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.64,0:14:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,he was granted the honorary\Ntitle of Rook and has
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.84,0:14:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,been entrusted with full\Nauthority over security.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.62,0:14:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay, but why are you bringing\Nall this junk up now, Jinbe?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.98,0:14:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If the security guards are on our side,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.28,0:14:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,then there will be nothing\Nthat can stand in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.68,0:14:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.59,0:14:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you getting at?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.96,0:14:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The main event of the tea party\Nwill be the wedding ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.24,0:14:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It is at this time that we think Big Mom
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.30,0:14:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,intends to take out the\Nentire Vinsmoke family
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.74,0:14:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,in order to seize control\Nof Jerma's assets.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.26,0:14:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But Veggie is planning to\Ntake Big Mom's head himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.50,0:14:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.50,0:14:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.06,0:14:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We got conspiracies everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.42,0:14:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.16,0:14:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Peckhams fell into Veggie's hands\Nafter guiding you to this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.06,0:15:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And so he knows about\Nthe assassination, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.38,0:15:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Buggy offered him a deal if he\Ncooperated with their proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.30,0:15:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.24,0:15:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I wondered about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.72,0:15:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Peckhams was too loyal to accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.22,0:15:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Buggy shot him into shark-infested\Nwaters in order to silence him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.18,0:15:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaaahhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.26,0:15:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily, some of my companions witnessed\Nthat and saved him in the nick of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.82,0:15:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He is currently recuperating.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.94,0:15:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.38,0:15:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.62,0:15:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that poor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.12,0:15:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been through a lot of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.16,0:15:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.38,0:15:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that veggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.64,0:15:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make him pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.60,0:16:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I have yet to make my main point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.86,0:16:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.18,0:16:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,After we learned of the assassination\Nplot from Peckhams, we made a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.18,0:16:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to anticipate how\Nyou would handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.36,0:16:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew one thing for certain, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.82,0:16:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you were wise to the scheme, you'd\Nwant to rescue Sanji and his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.36,0:16:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,i have sympathy for\Npeckham's but under these
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.10,0:16:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,circumstances can we really afford to make
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.54,0:16:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,an enemy of benji the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.54,0:16:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,tea party starts at
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.56,0:16:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,10 in the morning roughly\Nfive hours from now
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.68,0:16:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,that grants the 10 of us very\Nlittle time to craft up a plan
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.30,0:16:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,stop including us in your damn\Nnumber You ignorant morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.32,0:16:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We are so good at telling you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.68,0:16:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You must consider this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.68,0:16:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Benji not only runs security, but has\Nfully prepared for tomorrow's operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.28,0:17:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, to succeed, I\Npropose we team up with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.90,0:17:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.52,0:17:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe, I think you're right on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.88,0:17:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, seriously, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.14,0:17:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're agreeing to this plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.78,0:17:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the spirit! I knew you would be!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.54,0:17:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, listen, this may be a bad idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.86,0:17:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard his backstory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.74,0:17:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Veggie is a Newgate crook.\NI don't know. Can't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.24,0:17:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be worth a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.80,0:17:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, think it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.90,0:17:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already made the arrangements.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.00,0:17:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,When would you like to speak with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.90,0:17:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.76,0:17:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't worry, you may\Nrefuse if something feels
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.32,0:17:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,off our goal is slightly\Ndifferent from theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.10,0:17:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway luffy sanji Buggy and\Nhis men are set up in the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.88,0:18:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,northwest part of the island the\Neight of us will head directly
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.54,0:18:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,there from within this\Ndimension we'll see you shortly
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.42,0:18:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,you're counting us again aren't\Nyou great meet you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.54,0:18:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you snuff out Bobbin?\NUh-huh, I sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.54,0:18:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,he was tailing blackleg\Nyou can't threaten Germa
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.68,0:18:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,not on my watch you're\Nsure these guys won't
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.46,0:18:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,get cold feet more than\Nthat you trust them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.98,0:18:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe ain't no grifter\Nand he ain't no funny man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.10,0:18:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Aside from sharing a common\Ninterest with his pals
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.66,0:18:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,we don't want to make any new enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.70,0:18:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,if we plan on throwing lead at big mom
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.80,0:18:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,now the rest of this ride's on Straw Hat
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:19:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,if he tries anything funny
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.94,0:19:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll pop him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.24,0:19:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,To be
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.34,0:19:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,continued...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.50,0:19:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,As all your tears flow once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.20,0:19:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the song of pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.44,0:19:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Brings forth more fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, since life is sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.96,0:19:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let dessert be sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.26,0:19:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A cake, oh, so sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.06,0:20:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That it can't be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.22,0:20:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's share. Let's share.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.76,0:20:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Love be delight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.20,0:20:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't, Peckhams.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.86,0:20:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You need your rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.70,0:20:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.84,0:20:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you at least tell me that Jinbe went
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.60,0:20:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,to warn Mama about that backstabbing Page?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.30,0:20:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.02,0:20:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Most certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.93,0:20:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.85,0:20:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd wager that by now, Big Mom must be\Nbeating him within an inch of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.58,0:20:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.68,0:20:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A wager isn't good enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.66,0:20:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're wasting time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.98,0:20:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.20,0:20:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.56,0:21:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh, shh, shh, shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.72,0:21:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just focus on regaining\Nyour strength. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.62,0:21:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Braylene, I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.18,0:21:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to be sure that the\Ninformation will reach Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.66,0:21:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.57,0:21:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Peckhams, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.26,0:21:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe in Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.60,0:21:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't win a fight like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.36,0:21:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What if they do this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.82,0:21:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You will surely be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.60,0:21:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I, too, forbid you from leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.66,0:21:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I'm a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.90,0:21:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.81,0:21:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You need your R &R.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.80,0:21:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.72,0:21:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.90,0:21:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, come on up, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.16,0:21:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We love you, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.52,0:21:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.96,0:21:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting kind of skeptical here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.54,0:21:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.52,0:21:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.43,0:21:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot of night activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.54,0:21:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I swear, I saw you\Nguys moving around luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.30,0:21:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I do appreciate that you saved\Nmy life at all, but I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.94,0:21:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.56,0:22:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't allow that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.68,0:22:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, allow?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.96,0:22:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.14,0:22:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What could you be hiding from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.64,0:22:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.62,0:22:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's his base.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.82,0:22:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So this veggie, what's he like? You heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.92,0:22:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,what jimbae said yellow-bellied rat
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.84,0:22:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,let's be careful we've never dealt\Nwith a cutthroat mafia boss before
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.48,0:23:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my hero, Lili, Vinsmoke\NSanji of Germa, welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.26,0:23:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this is a treat, I'm delighted that\Nyou have made it. Oh boy, it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.00,0:23:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you bitchy, let's gather your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.08,0:23:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not rush things, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.96,0:23:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You could at least give me a hello Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.54,0:23:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw your Lelos!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.48,0:23:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there you guys are!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.80,0:23:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Soji!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.84,0:23:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You made me so worried, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.36,0:23:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, my bad. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.22,0:23:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You look, uh, comfortable?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.44,0:23:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, totally!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.84,0:23:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You two, come take a bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.04,0:23:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.95,0:23:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.04,0:23:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you so relaxed?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.40,0:23:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even like baths!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you have no say in the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.40,0:23:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Go scrub up, then we'll talk a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.72,0:23:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're forcing us to bathe?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.22,0:23:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Clearly, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.66,0:24:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The Godfather won't meet\Nwith an unclean guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.58,0:24:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.98,0:24:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.89,0:24:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola was turned into a warthog zombie?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.36,0:24:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.38,0:24:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She chased down a guy\Nbecause she was lovesick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.92,0:24:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, does that sound like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.10,0:24:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I would\Nhave done without Lola.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.20,0:24:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She saved me back then, and she saved\Nme now with that tree monster, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.12,0:24:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So you say, but it sounds to me\Nlike you saved Lola just as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.26,0:24:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.62,0:24:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at me, cry and\Nsee the joy. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.50,0:24:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been close ever\Nsince we were little kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.72,0:24:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're twins, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.64,0:24:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Zombies?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.55,0:25:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Dead people walking around again?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.88,0:25:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea's such a wonderland.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.16,0:25:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So then, did Moa turn back\Ninto a human? She did.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.16,0:25:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she's living her\Nbest life as a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.88,0:25:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I always think of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.68,0:25:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope she found love.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.46,0:25:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,From what I remember, Big\NMom was upset with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.00,0:25:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,For running away from a marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.24,0:25:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.28,0:25:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a big scandal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.22,0:25:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.66,0:25:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All the world's giants despise Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.80,0:25:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,For something that happened before.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.38,0:25:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They all hate her?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.38,0:25:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.64,0:25:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so even though there's a\Ndiverse population. In Totoland.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.98,0:25:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no giants here. Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.42,0:25:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Giants are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.06,0:25:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,One day,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.36,0:25:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,a man showed up,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.14,0:26:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,claiming it was love at first sight\Nand had interest in marrying Lola.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.12,0:26:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out he was Loki, the prince of Elbaf,\Nthe giant's country. A prince? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.72,0:26:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama was practically brought to tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.84,0:26:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If Lola became the princess of Elbaf,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.94,0:26:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,her long-standing feud with\Nthe giants would be resolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.66,0:26:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,She also had her eyes set\Non their massive army,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.46,0:26:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,which is said to be amongst\Nthe world's strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.48,0:26:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.08,0:26:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's why she ran away, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.18,0:26:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, things got messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.20,0:26:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama even tried to pass me off as Lola.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.60,0:26:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally, the prince noticed right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.94,0:26:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This made things even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.44,0:26:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama got desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.18,0:26:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She abandoned the entire idea of having\Ngenuine giants here in Toto Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.28,0:27:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, she started investing in\Nresearch to gigantify normal people.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.52,0:27:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Her rage towards Lola had grown even stronger,\Nand then Mama branded her a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.60,0:27:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So, if she comes back, she'll be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.80,0:27:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And considering I look just like her,\NMama can't stand the sight of me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.26,0:27:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.88,0:27:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It disgusts me to look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.60,0:27:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was around, she took it out\Non me. She beat and abused me for.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.94,0:27:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,years that Woman is a monster she's
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.62,0:27:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,no mother to me forcing her own
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.96,0:27:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,daughter to fear for her life it's
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.50,0:27:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,terrible
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.41,0:27:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.88,0:27:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.12,0:27:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,is a free spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.42,0:27:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,the thought that mama would want a\Nkiller would never even cross a mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.40,0:27:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,She's too pure-hearted.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.10,0:27:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It all makes sense now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.06,0:27:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We've both had it bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.88,0:27:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, That's why when Veggie\Nsaid that he would murder Mama,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.62,0:28:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't feel anything inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.70,0:28:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I a bad person?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.84,0:28:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. It's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.04,0:28:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.06,0:28:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What a wonderful path!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.46,0:28:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what heaven is like.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.64,0:28:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you tempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.62,0:28:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like we wrapped up a big fight,\Nbut it's just starting. Don't get comfy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.90,0:28:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy? Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.42,0:28:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what I found! Come quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.88,0:28:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I found milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.68,0:28:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.82,0:28:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,At least ask before you\Nguys look in our fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.68,0:28:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just what I needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.32,0:28:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, look, my tooth cracked. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.44,0:28:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather, my whole face cracked.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.92,0:28:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.83,0:28:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We needed this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.12,0:29:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.10,0:29:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive you, Siobhan.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.12,0:29:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.54,0:29:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.45,0:29:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really gonna help the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.62,0:29:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.98,0:29:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It got over please you know it those guys\Ndon't stand a chance mama will be livid.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.80,0:29:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen Barrel you know what she's\Ndone to me that woman's evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.22,0:29:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola's in danger too. Veggie and Pez\Nare my family. No one else matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.90,0:29:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh it's okay sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.32,0:29:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.36,0:29:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That should be everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.44,0:29:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your keisters are so clean you\Ncould eat off of them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.38,0:29:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They say clothes make the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.74,0:29:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I won't humor no mooks who\Ndon't care about their appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.64,0:30:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, there's three\Nand a half hours to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.62,0:30:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,let's decide are we
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.72,0:30:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,doing this or no deal
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.66,0:30:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You two just can't help\Nyourselves, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.80,0:30:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.71,0:30:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not for us to eat? Try one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.14,0:30:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are nothing\Nbut a liability to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.18,0:30:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Commit me otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.30,0:30:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The tidiest solution for this would\Nbe to murder you all on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.98,0:30:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Think it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.62,0:31:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If I die, you're throwing away\Nyour one chance to kill Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.84,0:31:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There'll be no wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.34,0:31:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, if I'm not back there at\Nleast two hours before the wedding,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.90,0:31:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll come snooping.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.96,0:31:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Point taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.44,0:31:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can figure out a\Nworkaround for that, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.90,0:31:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How's about I off your pals?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.90,0:31:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for Intimidation Gage!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.10,0:31:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, what's your intuition\Ntelling you about this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.50,0:31:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Trustworthy?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.16,0:31:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is Caesar here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.56,0:31:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Caesar! Where? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.80,0:31:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.92,0:31:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.83,0:31:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you not notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.34,0:32:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This research is never\Ngoing to lead us anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.30,0:32:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm giving up now before I go crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.44,0:32:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your worst, Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.14,0:32:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm afraid of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.50,0:32:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Seize a clown, I presume?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.38,0:32:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I was taking five. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.08,0:32:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell Big Mom I'm working my ass off.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.30,0:32:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.90,0:32:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.36,0:32:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,See, I was put in charge\Nof watching over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.32,0:32:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All I had to do was ask somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.84,0:32:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I do as I please now\Nthat I'm a trusted rook.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.82,0:32:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's mine! Curse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.12,0:32:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can bust you out of here, but I'm\Ngonna need you to scratch my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.46,0:32:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You numbskull!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.78,0:33:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just who in the hell do you\Nthink you're talking to anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.26,0:33:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you realize I'm capable\Nof destroying the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.64,0:33:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a genius, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.12,0:33:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.76,0:33:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.68,0:33:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.24,0:33:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.40,0:33:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,First Big Mom and now Veggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.78,0:33:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare they put me to\Nwork like I'm some dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.04,0:33:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Working on your task still, Lili? Clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.32,0:33:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just who do you take me for, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.92,0:33:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, this project's\Nmore my cup of tea anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.70,0:33:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Every minute, I inch closer to\Ncompleting my greatest work of art.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.14,0:33:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Good to know, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.24,0:33:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are on their way\Nand should be arriving shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.90,0:33:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming here!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.68,0:33:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope to never see those losers again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.90,0:33:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When they're around, anything\Nthat can go wrong will!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.98,0:34:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The Godfather wanted me to tell you you\Nwill be attending the meeting too, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.70,0:34:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.54,0:34:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a fine mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.82,0:34:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.22,0:34:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.34,0:34:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm, uh, Veggie's older half-brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.20,0:34:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The name's Gangster\NGastino, you little punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.70,0:34:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not even trying to hide it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.16,0:34:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That name is so fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.32,0:34:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, Caesar?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.56,0:34:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,His laugh, it's still the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.88,0:34:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My mistake. Different\Nguy. Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.06,0:34:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You were great, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.40,0:34:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's obviously Caesar. You liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.08,0:34:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it had to be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.02,0:34:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.78,0:34:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think this is my choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.68,0:34:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Use your head, dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.06,0:35:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't tell me you people\Nforgot where you last left me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.18,0:35:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My only ticket out of a certain death\Nwas to become this bozo's personal slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.12,0:35:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's holding my heart, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.46,0:35:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You better tell Trafalgar Law that\NI'm gonna gut him when I see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.74,0:35:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm coming for you\Nafter. All right, enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.24,0:35:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Can it, you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.26,0:35:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wasting my precious time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.10,0:35:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Lay it on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.36,0:35:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We gonna play nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.18,0:35:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, are we done?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.24,0:35:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me punch you for shooting\NPeckums first, then we can talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.50,0:35:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Lili?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.90,0:35:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.50,0:35:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.32,0:36:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Put your fist down right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.56,0:36:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't helping the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.92,0:36:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But this jerk shot my buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.26,0:36:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you speak to the\NGodfather like that. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.14,0:36:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Lower your barrel, Fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.62,0:36:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you stop? It's okay. Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.90,0:36:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I kicked them out already.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.38,0:36:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.70,0:36:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.50,0:36:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.30,0:36:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that one fact alone makes\Nus allies. We may not share.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.12,0:36:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,ideals or lifestyles but we\Nall have a common enemy here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.44,0:36:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Settle your differences at a later time!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.72,0:36:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's cooperation will be\Nnecessary for gaining the upper hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.90,0:37:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.28,0:37:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got every last detail worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.88,0:37:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get it over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.28,0:37:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll be done with you fools for good.
